  "2026-10-21T23:26:52.688Z",codex-agent,"Targeted documentation suite: 5 passed, 0 failed. Typecheck and lint passed. Revert proof: restoring only the original README makes the new README regression exit 1; restoring the corrected README passes. Fresh npx and bunx registry acceptance is being recorded separately."
  "2026-10-21T23:29:15.885Z",codex-agent,"Fresh plain-directory README verification with CLI 2026.10.21: npx init exit 0; npx registry install exit 0; bunx init exit 0; bunx registry install exit 0. Each runner used its own empty project and home/config directories, with no Git repository. Public package activation only; database/server readiness remains separate."
