  "2026-10-21T23:49:03.178Z",codex-agent,"Full npm run release:check completed with exit 0: 764 passed / 0 failed / 0 skipped; measured coverage over 47 source files is 92.86% statements and lines, 82.59% branches, 96.26% functions, meeting unchanged thresholds. Capacity smoke and packed acceptance passed. README npx/bunx init/install commands all exit 0; targeted and linked docs suites pass 5/5 and README-only revert fails. Full Bun gate is running; final Bun and exact-head CI receipts will be recorded in the PR body. No source runtime, dependency pin or deployment change."
